# Local-only agent files. These name the operator's private LAN, paths and hardware; this repo is
# PUBLIC. They must never be committed — see the "Public-repo hygiene" rule in CLAUDE.local.md.
#
# NOTE: `CLAUDE.md` itself IS committed and public — it is what a coding agent reads on a fresh
# clone to set the project up, so ignoring it would defeat the point. Anything environment-specific
# belongs in CLAUDE.local.md, which every agent also reads and which never leaves this machine.
